{
  "dom_id": "step-e10304",
  "name": "Example: Finding Cumulative Probabilities Given Values From the Joint CDF",
  "problem": "Suppose ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/46833dd7644e5c60bb4525fe4e7649a99752b26096331755a4b44c2abe183f11.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/ab4817775494786b06f0b9cecf225ea5979c035b69c36c1fa078f835524be9e9.svg) are discrete random variables. Let the joint CDF of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/46833dd7644e5c60bb4525fe4e7649a99752b26096331755a4b44c2abe183f11.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/ab4817775494786b06f0b9cecf225ea5979c035b69c36c1fa078f835524be9e9.svg) be ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/45ba004dac2f7f8efb58a5071b600dded19307f6fbc2bc376cc780ec2054b4fa.svg) where\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/47adc5d8b26f9b62b8f051b7b68b7100060841ecb29cde0e38e7b417d0373855.svg)\n\nand the supports of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/46833dd7644e5c60bb4525fe4e7649a99752b26096331755a4b44c2abe183f11.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/ab4817775494786b06f0b9cecf225ea5979c035b69c36c1fa078f835524be9e9.svg), respectively, are\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/c2eae5ac498b77fffad4a4903f54ec0a15c51a7477f84215483752bdeeef0bab.svg)\n\nFind ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/4c28154b55d157211d489b908d786504dd07515970926a784570fad2911cc3dd.svg)",
  "worked_solution": "Note the following:\n\n- For a given joint PMF ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/7f3705d5dab288c1c6774f437aa18dea961252d741fb302b399cb2ad18112a3a.svg) we can think of each point where ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/d17e98e4e46a13b4d2d8f97bbcf008c339ed281a929aa3eec7ecdd7b63a9ac92.svg) as a point mass in the plane, where the \"probability mass\" at each point equals the probability associated with that point.\n\n- The joint CDF ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/246748e439e0fd3d76529b637ab1ac09d2308e45a826924cee283c1e9252e6ea.svg) is the total \"probability mass\" that lies in the infinite rectangular region that has its top-right corner at ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/e76592a69e19fffc93e0e39005deba219d59736a203a18c95ebbe2496bd772a7.svg) and whose sides are parallel to the coordinate axis.\n\nGiven the supports of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/46833dd7644e5c60bb4525fe4e7649a99752b26096331755a4b44c2abe183f11.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/07fd689b67975f50da1b6b025460996fc87f21f758f5e98d34eb84c9b0e50fcd.svg) the joint support ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/4d93e1f4798eafa4154488dfcd1445e7ca86009a6be22534670492eab898da62.svg) is a subset of\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/68fe320dd4e3c957e92b5440e79abcf8ac9303c2b215df300ad0c5a8d2f51071.svg)\n\nLet's sketch the points in ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/48162c9ef32c06765d5fc93f0f8d7e71457d6951bea5d902700551014a70650f.svg) which contains the joint support.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/a9f7d560d9a8110931ceb182ad4fc14d87c55ffc4440179dfea5ce7e99a1400f.png)\n\nLet's sketch the region corresponding to the probability we wish to find.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/9812836b2d4e19cc59460fc3482ee0a83a876d991a8ed8e0672aa93527bbfd2e.png)\n\nGeometrically, this region can be obtained as follows:\n\n1\\. Take the infinite rectangle that has its top-right corner at ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/8cc3fad1e270890ee0856aaba2280c0a9fad74c9a936e214e03b65d89945b27c.svg)\n\n2\\. Subtract the infinite rectangles that have their top-right corners at ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/3d6f6e7066b5c3acd802358410eeabf93c9362edeb1c199ba6a988907d6edf34.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/ef85d6b6f088b37f977b242067d158c487d8268faef1f8c4fb8f00455570ae22.svg)\n\n3\\. Finally, we need to add back the infinite rectangle that has its top-right corner at ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/74527b4b8d703ba5b9fa8bfb60c5ea4c65feeed6024c3ecdbb6075007e3dc7da.svg) This is because we subtracted this region twice in step 2.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14157784/assets/76f062fddcb06564b51de85ec9dc1ba76cd2499a559ab54de725529da7c684e8.svg)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e10304\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding Cumulative Probabilities Given Values From the Joint CDF</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e10304\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Suppose <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.928ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 852 683\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D44B\" d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 306 224T411 342Q302 620 297 625Q288 636 234 637H206Q200 643 200 645T202 664Q206 677 212 683H226Q260 681 347 681Q380 681 408 681T453 682T473 682Q490 682 490 671Q490 670 488 658Q484 643 481 640T465 637Q434 634 411 620L488 426L541 485Q646 598 646 610Q646 628 622 635Q617 635 609 637Q594 637 594 648Q594 650 596 664Q600 677 606 683H618Q619 683 643 683T697 681T738 680Q828 680 837 683H845Q852 676 852 672Q850 647 840 637H824Q790 636 763 628T722 611T698 593L687 584Q687 585 592 480L505 384Q505 383 536 304T601 142T638 56Q648 47 699 46Q734 46 734 37Q734 35 732 23Q728 7 725 4T711 1Q708 1 678 1T589 2Q528 2 496 2T461 1Q444 1 444 10Q444 11 446 25Q448 35 450 39T455 44T464 46T480 47T506 54Q523 62 523 64Q522 64 476 181L429 299Q241 95 236 84Q232 76 232 72Q232 53 261 47Q262 47 267 47T273 46Q276 46 277 46T280 45T283 42T284 35Q284 26 282 19Q279 6 276 4T261 1Q258 1 243 1T201 2T142 2Q64 2 42 0Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.726ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 763 683\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D44C\" d=\"M66 637Q54 637 49 637T39 638T32 641T30 647T33 664T42 682Q44 683 56 683Q104 680 165 680Q288 680 306 683H316Q322 677 322 674T320 656Q316 643 310 637H298Q242 637 242 624Q242 619 292 477T343 333L346 336Q350 340 358 349T379 373T411 410T454 461Q546 568 561 587T577 618Q577 634 545 637Q528 637 528 647Q528 649 530 661Q533 676 535 679T549 683Q551 683 578 682T657 680Q684 680 713 681T746 682Q763 682 763 673Q763 669 760 657T755 643Q753 637 734 637Q662 632 617 587Q608 578 477 424L348 273L322 169Q295 62 295 57Q295 46 363 46Q379 46 384 45T390 35Q390 33 388 23Q384 6 382 4T366 1Q361 1 324 1T232 2Q170 2 138 2T102 1Q84 1 84 9Q84 14 87 24Q88 27 89 30T90 35T91 39T93 42T96 44T101 45T107 45T116 46T129 46Q168 47 180 50T198 63Q201 68 227 171L252 274L129 623Q128 624 127 625T125 627T122 629T118 631T113 633T105 634T96 635T83 636T66 637Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are discrete random variables. Let the joint CDF of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.928ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 852 683\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D44B\" d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 306 224T411 342Q302 620 297 625Q288 636 234 637H206Q200 643 200 645T202 664Q206 677 212 683H226Q260 681 347 681Q380 681 408 681T453 682T473 682Q490 682 490 671Q490 670 488 658Q484 643 481 640T465 637Q434 634 411 620L488 426L541 485Q646 598 646 610Q646 628 622 635Q617 635 609 637Q594 637 594 648Q594 650 596 664Q600 677 606 683H618Q619 683 643 683T697 681T738 680Q828 680 837 683H845Q852 676 852 672Q850 647 840 637H824Q790 636 763 628T722 611T698 593L687 584Q687 585 592 480L505 384Q505 383 536 304T601 142T638 56Q648 47 699 46Q734 46 734 37Q734 35 732 23Q728 7 725 4T711 1Q708 1 678 1T589 2Q528 2 496 2T461 1Q444 1 444 10Q444 11 446 25Q448 35 450 39T455 44T464 46T480 47T506 54Q523 62 523 64Q522 64 476 181L429 299Q241 95 236 84Q232 76 232 72Q232 53 261 47Q262 47 267 47T273 46Q276 46 277 46T280 45T283 42T284 35Q284 26 282 19Q279 6 276 4T261 1Q258 1 243 1T201 2T142 2Q64 2 42 0Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.726ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 763 683\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D44C\" d=\"M66 637Q54 637 49 637T39 638T32 641T30 647T33 664T42 682Q44 683 56 683Q104 680 165 680Q288 680 306 683H316Q322 677 322 674T320 656Q316 643 310 637H298Q242 637 242 624Q242 619 292 477T343 333L346 336Q350 340 358 349T379 373T411 410T454 461Q546 568 561 587T577 618Q577 634 545 637Q528 637 528 647Q528 649 530 661Q533 676 535 679T549 683Q551 683 578 682T657 680Q684 680 713 681T746 682Q763 682 763 673Q763 669 760 657T755 643Q753 637 734 637Q662 632 617 587Q608 578 477 424L348 273L322 169Q295 62 295 57Q295 46 363 46Q379 46 384 45T390 35Q390 33 388 23Q384 6 382 4T366 1Q361 1 324 1T232 2Q170 2 138 2T102 1Q84 1 84 9Q84 14 87 24Q88 27 89 30T90 35T91 39T93 42T96 44T101 45T107 45T116 46T129 46Q168 47 180 50T198 63Q201 68 227 171L252 274L129 623Q128 624 127 625T125 627T122 629T118 631T113 633T105 634T96 635T83 636T66 637Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> be <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.492ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3311.7 1000\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D439\" d=\"M48 1Q31 1 31 11Q31 13 34 25Q38 41 42 43T65 46Q92 46 125 49Q139 52 144 61Q146 66 215 342T285 622Q285 629 281 629Q273 632 228 634H197Q191 640 191 642T193 659Q197 676 203 680H742Q749 676 749 669Q749 664 736 557T722 447Q720 440 702 440H690Q683 445 683 453Q683 454 686 477T689 530Q689 560 682 579T663 610T626 626T575 633T503 634H480Q398 633 393 631Q388 629 386 623Q385 622 352 492L320 363H375Q378 363 398 363T426 364T448 367T472 374T489 386Q502 398 511 419T524 457T529 475Q532 480 548 480H560Q567 475 567 470Q567 467 536 339T502 207Q500 200 482 200H470Q463 206 463 212Q463 215 468 234T473 274Q473 303 453 310T364 317H309L277 190Q245 66 245 60Q245 46 334 46H359Q365 40 365 39T363 19Q359 6 353 0H336Q295 2 185 2Q120 2 86 2T48 1Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(749,0)\"><path data-c=\"28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1138,0)\"><path data-c=\"1D465\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1710,0)\"><path data-c=\"2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2154.7,0)\"><path data-c=\"1D466\" d=\"M21 287Q21 301 36 335T84 406T158 442Q199 442 224 419T250 355Q248 336 247 334Q247 331 231 288T198 191T182 105Q182 62 196 45T238 27Q261 27 281 38T312 61T339 94Q339 95 344 114T358 173T377 247Q415 397 419 404Q432 431 462 431Q475 431 483 424T494 412T496 403Q496 390 447 193T391 -23Q363 -106 294 -155T156 -205Q111 -205 77 -183T43 -117Q43 -95 50 -80T69 -58T89 -48T106 -45Q150 -45 150 -87Q150 -107 138 -122T115 -142T102 -147L99 -148Q101 -153 118 -160T152 -167H160Q177 -167 186 -165Q219 -156 247 -127T290 -65T313 -9T321 21L315 17Q309 13 296 6T270 -6Q250 -11 231 -11Q185 -11 150 11T104 82Q103 89 103 113Q103 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2644.7,0)\"><path data-c=\"29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3033.7,0)\"><path data-c=\"2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> where</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG