8 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> which contains the joint support.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-68780b7664ae7c500aec8915cc432d56\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/68780b7664ae7c500aec8915cc432d56\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Let's sketch the region corresponding to the probability we wish to find.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-2d2583acc2231523f8045e778d06bcd7\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/2d2583acc2231523f8045e778d06bcd7\"></div>\n\n\n<p>Geometrically, this region can be obtained as follows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>Take the infinite rectangle that has its top-right corner at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.658ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2500.7 1000\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><path data-c=\"28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><path data-c=\"35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q13